{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "96cdfb091b5bd57ceba947bb17d5c3be25a21e354827caa864e96c4b01460e36", "ja": "VR……失恋体験？", "zh": "VR……失恋体验？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "da6f55d92adde4f566d7d725321e73ff37dc96a9e8f7cbe6c68b55774d617f50", "ja": "失恋の気持ちを掴むため、イメトレを試みる\n一同だったが、成果は微妙。ツッコミどころ\nの多さに思わず口を挟んでしまうプロデュー\nサーに怒る莉緒と真美。フォローする琴葉。\nそんな中、雪歩は1人ため息をついていた。", "zh": "为了体会失恋的心情，大家尝试进行了\n意象训练，但成果却很微妙。面对满是槽点\n而忍不住插嘴的制作人，莉绪和真美发火了。\n琴叶在一旁打圆场。\n就在此时，雪步却1个人叹着气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bbb4734197f43055cd9dc063b1d40b6a38fe1695b15ab074cfd4046a021f6359", "ja": "（合宿2日目。莉緒の発案で、新しくできた\nビーチカフェ……オシャレな海の家にやってきた）", "zh": "（合宿第2天。在莉绪的提议下，我们来到了新开的海滩咖啡馆……一家时髦的海之家）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "25a3af5b3c87f889dffcb1ae920e8d6a747fc7fe1bc86300945c0a732e4f4b33", "ja": "どう、素敵なカフェでしょ？　私の好きなブランドが\n経営してるの。前からチェックしてたのよね～♪", "zh": "怎么样，很棒的咖啡馆吧？是我喜欢的品牌经营的。我之前就一直关注着呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e6121e26d4eccae8a342d96e013aba0064aa26465ad50d304acbf73a81a948f8", "ja": "とっても、素敵です……こんなお店を知ってるなんて、\nやっぱり莉緒さんは大人ですね……♪", "zh": "太棒了，真是家很棒的咖啡馆……没想到莉绪小姐居然知道这样的店，果然很成熟呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0601bffbc7218b5aa256cc49311ff976ff13ec3e7deb56a924c2edd72fc4f6b2", "ja": "エレナと恵美に、写真を送ろうっと。\nでも、ズルいって怒られちゃうかな……？", "zh": "我把照片发给艾蕾娜和惠美吧。\n不过，会不会被她们说太狡猾了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "861ace4e4eb8da55e776ef7325a8a7d283959db7d16d768a9d1c885277095f1e", "ja": "その時は、一緒に来ればいいのよ♪\n{$P$}くんはどう？　感想。", "zh": "到时候一起来不就好了♪\n{$P$}，你觉得怎么样？有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1cd44624b74b89ded7bdd4469371e0024fd5c1f17586c73ce71216d9d2f3c10e", "ja": "ああ、素敵なカフェだな。でも、ハジケる練習と\nオシャレなカフェが、どう繋がるんだ？", "zh": "啊，真是家很棒的咖啡馆啊。不过，练习迸发活力和时髦的咖啡馆，这两者有什么联系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "430a35229e9c253f488133cba9bebefff011ee9256cc2af24945e3a3465a3390", "ja": "え～、繋がってるじゃん！\n兄ちゃん、そんなコトもわかんないの？", "zh": "诶～，这不是联系在一起的吗！  \n哥哥，连这种事都不明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "47a437b44f07d2157fa7360e8ac313291b6d7cd310fb9d357743c2e87f9b6f77", "ja": "ずばり、『VR失恋体験』だよ♪", "zh": "没错，就是“VR失恋体验”哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c91f8a0627fd67d02a7d611e6ac32ffe557d75167c6e79319d56f88844fa40fc", "ja": "VR……なんだって？", "zh": "VR……什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "0c8f3ee1392aaa3436f3350d1dda138e9beaba849d654bd7877a2d505f9e5f99", "ja": "簡単に言うと、失恋体験してみようってことね。", "zh": "简单来说，就是想让你体验一下失恋吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b4c90ee5fe15e6534ad7fca22c0412db6d2040a64fe5d52fbcb325083bb5216a", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、私、失恋しちゃうんですかぁ！？\nそんな、れ、恋愛だってまだなのに……！", "zh": "诶！？我、我会失恋吗！？\n怎么这样，我、我明明连恋爱都还没谈过……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "7006bc137434d6aeabf76eb7ea9987f756a1220843b389926d513f5aac05ff0e", "ja": "そ、そうだよね。失恋……の前に、恋愛しないと……\nでも、アイドルに恋愛は禁物なんじゃ……。", "zh": "对、对啊。要失恋……之前，也得先谈恋爱才行……\n可是，偶像不是不可以谈恋爱吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3638177622acd5f02b4c123427b5f7acbc90c07b609b1615852030f37b0af815", "ja": "そうだな……ところで、\nVRって言ってたけど、具体的にどんな内容なんだ？", "zh": "是啊……话说回来，\n你刚才说VR，具体是什么内容？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "e6de35e076a789d8af723f8e77ec5ace388715fcd5fd3cd715f0e066ec4cb8ce", "ja": "まあ、見てて？　ええと……あっ。あそこに、\n雪歩ちゃん達くらいの年の男の子がいるでしょ？", "zh": "先看着嘛？呃……啊。那边不是有个\n和雪步她们差不多大的男孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "43018a260014f3309d14be53a8252a261403616f3dab6b9be6e4e35b57798514", "ja": "おっ！　まあまあのイケメンだね。\nけど、ウチのまこちんには敵いませんなぁ。", "zh": "哦！还算挺帅的嘛。  \n不过，跟我们家真真比起来还是差远啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "e0163d3004c0125fca4acbef7375eef02b1cdd2b4ba0bc86bd1b63a8b357d3fc", "ja": "大事なのはここからよ。あの男の子のことを、\n自分の好きな人だって想定してみて。", "zh": "重要的在后面哦。试着把那个男孩子，\n假想成自己喜欢的人看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f367c77fa70fb071453aaf236c6a1d9ebd846de58ed591be935740396b13d7f", "ja": "あ、もちろんあくまで仮によ？\n要するに、イメージトレーニングってこと♪", "zh": "啊，当然只是暂时假设一下哦？\n也就是说，就是想象训练♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4b86a9a0e5ecfd911a1df1c1e02354309ce3b357907b30fba20409f5eb346ac9", "ja": "イメージトレーニング……。", "zh": "想象训练……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6ef695da0d58ee18883f137ff8c79576a6f39d3978911d403ad676f6bf78a9af", "ja": "なるほど……。でも、ちゃんとできるかなぁ。\n話したこともない人を好きになるなんて……。", "zh": "原来如此……可是，真的能做好吗？\n居然会喜欢上从没说过话的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ce038956cb9f6c690e014e94f986d307f881b29c5a60ebb836886298fe6d325", "ja": "そうだね……恋愛ドラマの演技だと思えば……\nあっ！", "zh": "是啊……如果把它当成恋爱电视剧来演的话……\n啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "e19476451ae1ee00c8e5d547ed2f125ece4cfa79d96540860947c20df5fe5301", "ja": "り、莉緒さん！\nあの男性のところに、別の女性が！？", "zh": "莉、莉绪姐！\n那个男人身边还有别的女性！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f348d0875d27e4175432aede6fdcbd3e9bb8f0ce98311cb179211bd1ad94bff0", "ja": "ふ、ふたりともなんだか楽しそう……お友達かな？\n距離も近くて……ああっ！？", "zh": "两、两个人看起来都很开心……是朋友吗？\n距离也好近……啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "f4b8b37ad3450272c99a88918992115dfb767d72e61fcb9f2e1828920a8ae9e4", "ja": "わお！　腕組んで、海の方に行っちゃったね……。\nめっちゃラブラブやないかーい！", "zh": "哇哦！还挽着手往海边走去了呢……\n这不是超级恩爱的嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "739c2a54a8b8e32db0447b54bff8db31a14251947c83e7c7bc52ff8dd30588cf", "ja": "私たち、なにもしないままフラれたことになりますね。\nこれも、失恋……なんでしょうか……？", "zh": "我们什么都没做就被人家甩了呢。\n这也算……失恋……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "75ddfe4351204d4c62ef2668736133969b72372f83077522070abc9c6666f592", "ja": "いや、あの人達は元々カップルで、\n待ち合わせしていただけだと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "不，我觉得他们本来就是情侣，只是在约定的地方见面而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f5bdcc4f05c385a44a8764a01ba734dc46e48a9a02986924fca62f4dce80144a", "ja": "というか、VRではなく、ただの現実だったな……。", "zh": "话说回来，这不是VR，而是单纯的现实啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "55d530e7919c88e75e3ed9ab90a27b440c9ef78fe420e33f680ce1b67db8f69e", "ja": "どう、みんな！？　好きな人にフラれて、\n悲しい、切ない気持ちになったんじゃない！？", "zh": "怎么样，大家！？被喜欢的人拒绝后，是不是感到又悲伤又难过了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "98a6061a6c6425e1c54eb7294938d1734f508f01265bf9dea31f15ad4ca1ac74", "ja": "ちょっと、むなしい気持ちにはなりましたけど……\nこれが失恋……なんでしょうか？", "zh": "虽然确实有点空虚……\n这就是失恋……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d2362744a18da64ec8a482c4d3bfad857ded3061486a9c9cf7e717aff688aefd", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、今のでよくわかったね。私なんて、\n好きになる前に終わっちゃったかも……ううっ。", "zh": "琴叶，你居然这么快就明白了啊。我啊，说不定还没喜欢上就已经结束了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "04e034f7afe97735d39eb5b5451b53e572a389b682cc1649836a3fcc0220ac3e", "ja": "琴葉……雪歩も、落ち込まなくていいと思う。\nそのむなしさは、多分別の理由じゃないかな……。", "zh": "琴叶……我觉得雪步也不用这么消沉。那种空虚感，大概是别的原因吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "fa83f5623935b5dfc86d9a5034c1bb07b46dc85c72cf0e00f9f15b38c47ae8b5", "ja": "も～、なによなによ！　{$P$}くん\nったら、さっきから文句ばっかり～！", "zh": "真是的～，搞什么呀！{$P$}\n真是的，从刚才开始就一直在抱怨～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "69e5f1ee85aad20b6022249dfb2212e7f4a29c10dc04fdec379f8ca7d025a08c", "ja": "そうだよ、兄ちゃん！\n真美とりおっちが一生懸命考えた特訓なのに！", "zh": "没错，哥哥！\n明明是真美和莉绪亲拼命想出来的特训啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "54c9b240bff569d5e57b51feb5ce880b8acaa0a810c3d0f75e2f75985132edf4", "ja": "いや、文句を言いたいわけじゃなくて……\nこれで失恋を体験できるのか、少し疑問というか。", "zh": "不是，我不是想抱怨……\n只是有点怀疑，这样真的能体验失恋吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "864f9b3ee74241716daf09e7308e47d3253d235afc2f6be26537c53c203a3115", "ja": "そんなに言うなら、{$P$}くんが\n特訓方法を考えてみなさいよー！", "zh": "既然你这么说，那就由{$P$}想想特训方法嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "6d330bccc0c360bb2d8e94191c20c73d9431d655f8f4dec32d668299a8e37aeb", "ja": "自分だって仕事が忙しくて、ステキな出会い♪\nなんて、これっぽっちもないくせにー！", "zh": "明明你自己工作也很忙，连一次美好的邂逅♪都没有——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "73cc8f56c4a24abcf3bfa6a4fff49eab59b12e6188e37505b1ad967d86e2e961", "ja": "そうだそうだー！\n兄ちゃんは仕事と真美たち、どっちが大事なの！？", "zh": "对对——！\n哥哥，工作和真美她们，哪个更重要？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "d401886f5198204dcf406b5bff573b7b9a65dc28bd1aea25d3afd03eddbec7bf", "ja": "そ、それは……！\nん？　……いや、それはどっちも同じじゃないか？", "zh": "那、那是……！\n嗯？……不对，工作和真美她们，不是同样重要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a6d4e13ce18d2fe325022f42d2c384a388965de80507ccaa84c8809bca0885a", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です、{$P$}！\n私は、お仕事熱心な男性って、素敵だと思いますから！", "zh": "没、没关系，{$P$}！\n因为我觉得，热衷于工作的男性很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9cd860675cf0783d06282aa5c10d5e4fbdb5b2a174996f160daa1697e139f771", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "742c04835efdbea4cf1d7c602c6d3b6af5b416d226ad711d648cc7bd09922f50", "ja": "（琴葉まで、莉緒と真美に感化されてきたな。\nこれで雪歩まで影響されたら……ん？）", "zh": "（连琴叶也被莉绪和真美影响了啊。要是连雪步也受到影响……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "40410908e145b76cd5a3d205439b7ab87511c0afc6feef3c47f0573e8c8238ae", "ja": "…………はあ～。", "zh": "…………唉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "12dd899c4318b19c888556621873a5ac61d8d978885ce366844d805972aae5b4", "ja": "（雪歩は、何を見て……あっ、さっきのカップルか。\n何か気になる事でもあるのか？）", "zh": "（雪步在看什么……啊，是刚才那对情侣啊。\n是有什么在意的事情吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "a01a1a478d3b23d4a7a9af8b0438271c6a2a09ccd0390a197bd648c597d15055", "ja": "（もしかして、失恋する気持ちを体験できたのか？\nそれとも……）", "zh": "（难道她体验到了失恋的心情？\n还是说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
